  Slug: wilderness-samsaran
  DisplayName: Wilderness Samsaran
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your preceding lives have been reborn in various remote environments
    away from major settlements in Tian Xia and beyond. Your past manifestations
    have had to learn how to survive on their own, and you recall this will to survive
    while possessing very little resources. You become trained in Survival. If you
    would automatically become trained in Survival (from your background or class,
    for example), you instead become trained in a skill of your choice. You can ignore
    difficult terrain from trees, foliage, and undergrowth.
